             (Z_to_bv 64 req) (wz cnt) s4 s5 (Z_to_bv 64 RMLOCK) (Z_to_bv 64 (RMLOCK + 8 * sc)) (wz size) s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6)
        F (Z_to_bv 64 0xac840) fc None m (seg_rom rsegs)).
